{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "76293100ea52e130ac4d25e90cb36d56d9766e409f9bb0dc88478b4cb0403a54", "ja": "（初公演後。今後の活動について、\nまつりの希望を聞いてみたところ……）", "zh": "（首场公演结束后，我试着询问了小祭今后的活动有什么希望……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "3a7a716bedcef247de64afb12f16adbeda41c5f8d7dc0eac8c5649e4a2f2dae4", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nまつりは、テレビに出てみたいのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我想试试上电视♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "4ee754dc6ecdf49fd4eabd13f86c24be1ec8fc1124b3c464e269f24691fc20ae", "ja": "劇場のステージももちろん出たいのです。\nでもアイドルになったからには、テレビなのです！", "zh": "剧场的舞台当然也想登上。  \n可是，既然都成为偶像了，就要上电视才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "03b8f85e9d49cd024114f0d6e452bd2e0f8627c17a60357a1f3253d7cdbde1a4", "ja": "テレビか……なるほど。じゃあ、\nアイドル番組のオーディションを受けてみるか？", "zh": "电视啊……原来如此。那要不要试着参加偶像节目的试镜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "cfaf7ba25acdfdea7535519a48bbd0d5d91d22e7d554955bc114f646db0e3007", "ja": "はいほー！　姫、挑戦してみるのです♪", "zh": "嗨嗨！本公主就来挑战一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8ca05adeaacea79965ea488781aa114c6f1b8e695defebb917f8476b13410c7a", "ja": "（それから幾つかの番組を受けてみたが、結果は\n芳しくない。審査員のウケは悪くないんだけど……）", "zh": "（之后也参加了几个节目试试，但结果并不理想。虽然评委的反应不算差……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5a08cbaf048c9c0046321ad972154a4137e340a26711292091c3529e79f6ba4a", "ja": "う～ん。やっぱり、まつりの個性的なキャラクターが、\n番組で使いづらいように思われているのかな……。", "zh": "嗯～。果然，还是觉得小祭个性鲜明的形象不太好在节目里发挥吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "41001e5dbdb2a32f978e08423c3c09e2c7452ac085bf95d81470698aee28f8a6", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん、\nまつりが個性的だと、どうして使いづらいのです？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}先生，既然茉莉很有个性，为什么会觉得不好安排呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "05898d1f3568036bb228486fc652d3ee29a5bef42a2d8deb797027f58fcffdef", "ja": "そうだな。個性が強いというのは、\nその人個人で見ると、すごくいい事なんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。个性鲜明这件事，\n单独看这个人，确实是件大好事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2876a52704e01313aede745b2e5fc1bdea2a225d8c0d6d5ee7f1bc2f8fdf5abe", "ja": "番組全体で見ると、他のアイドルを食ってしまう。\nそんな風に思われているのかもしれない。", "zh": "从整个节目来看，可能会让其他偶像黯然失色。也许大家是这么认为的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "2517cf7d9cef610214c565b7465074c19564fec53cb34f4c3052900c9a0819db", "ja": "姫が目立ってしまうと、ほかの子が目立たなくなる……\nということなのです？　難しいのです……。", "zh": "要是公主太引人注目的话，其他孩子就会变得不起眼……\n是这个意思吗？好难办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "01896cbc08c7eed4a0953203305773869f3593a2f8f9c28dca9e0391ad296ba4", "ja": "それが理由だとしたら、損をしてる事になる。出演の\n機会を潰すくらいなら、いっそキャラを変えて……。", "zh": "如果那是理由，那可就吃亏了。与其因为这个断送出演机会，不如干脆改变角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "920dabbe968a3ed2fe8fe5826a164665a88d4ed708728bd4462e0be2bcd0c93e", "ja": "むー！　{$P$}さん、\nまつりはキャラではないのです。姫は、姫なのです！", "zh": "唔——！{$P$}先生，\n茉莉才不是什么人设呢。公主就是公主哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "0cf4f60ab06d2f826a842e2ace7bffe3dbebb19930011826d941be196bb334ea", "ja": "まつりじゃないまつりでTVに出ても、それでは\n意味がないのです。そんなの、絶対にイヤなのですー！", "zh": "就算以“不是祭的祭”登上电视，那也\n没有意义。那种事，我绝对不要——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2477f8a0483e12e37ff8a59db3ea5af8bb82a899f7427eedab2359634294bfcc", "ja": "そうは言っても、このままじゃ……。", "zh": "话虽如此，可是这样下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "d1961b5aa55f4cc2c6a7e3a0c2306e7bdb96f0c39b07a72adc711e47698e1586", "ja": "姫は姫のままで、TVのお仕事がしたいのです。\n姫にぴったりな番組が、絶対にあるはずなのです！", "zh": "公主想继续保持公主的风格来做电视工作。\n一定有非常适合公主的节目的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "aec42a3942e3ea0c61e1895c21a373952d5ab3c50cc9c846ac2eca487bb74e89", "ja": "絶対に、諦めないのですよ！", "zh": "绝对不会放弃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a1902b878aa8600dc3cb289f7e1ad3fb744ea13d2e9bf2f1cd9dd6b7ac4301c6", "ja": "けど、そうなると……いや？\nまつりにピッタリの番組……そうか！", "zh": "不过，这样一来……不对？\n适合小茉莉的节目……有了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "e2c73220f76c61a3d590475cb0d713451a3b458407626229e7e897d4978bfc0e", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん……\nもしかして、何か閃いたのです？", "zh": "嗯？{$P$}先生……难道是想到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "71749e81fae424553df4846af18e3422468d54e9c440b0b563b607c37816a0ca", "ja": "ああ！　まつりのキャラを変えるんじゃなくて、\n受ける番組の路線を変えてみよう。", "zh": "啊！与其改变小玛茨莉的人设，不如试着改变她参加的节目的路线吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d8aacf8c50e79c2aba1789db2cd5f0e93bbf53690e95d56cfedd9346f61b1e77", "ja": "新人アイドルだし、アイドル番組と思っていたけど……\n普通のTV番組の方が、個性を活かせるかもしれない！", "zh": "毕竟是新人偶像，我本来以为应该参加偶像节目……不过，说不定普通的电视节目反而更能发挥个性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "7fd69c297f1b43479aa2706e29490396a8fb90067199ab5fbbbc4a4cc9638f3c", "ja": "わんだほー！　それでこそ、\nまつりの{$P$}さんなのです！", "zh": "太棒了！这才配得上做\n茉莉的{$P$}先生嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3dc8fb3e718686264afdef7dd474938e7ab3872452a61d0a619e7fc678a0eb82", "ja": "（それから様々なオーディションを調べ、\n情報系のバラエティ番組を受ける事にした）", "zh": "（之后查找了各种试镜，决定参加信息类综艺节目的试镜。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1023_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "aa5f774604c4dcada2b225d98ddda304f4987de878f1c0e45cd7fd55ae72610c", "ja": "わんだほー！　さっそく、合格したのです！\nさすが、姫の{$P$}さんなのです♪", "zh": "太棒了！马上就合格了呢！\n不愧是公主的{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "0e3d80601b68fcf4c26c1468ceeea696a8b65cba3fbeb84638e7526bf46c8331", "ja": "情報番組のレポート……姫の魔法の力で、\nとびきり、わかりやすくレポートしてくるのです♪", "zh": "信息节目的报道……就用本公主的魔法之力，去做一份特别易懂的报道回来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1026_weatherforecaster", "source_sha256": "9c60eb22e1f7735fa398d8ae4944cefccea6c4c7082f81347bbff70c4bac36be", "ja": "暫くは気温の変動が激しくなりそうです。\n以上、お天気情報でした！　続いて、徳川さ～ん？", "zh": "近期气温变化将会比较剧烈。\n以上是天气资讯！接下来，德川女——士？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "c32aff8f65dd8e674b8bb8f931d38c8a726c1d1633b24225191b0f2ff76a5b96", "ja": "はいほー！　テレビの前のみなさん、聞いたのです？\n気温差は、でんじゃらす！なのですよ。", "zh": "嗨哟——！电视机前的各位，听到了吗？气温差可是很危险的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "b983d9fad270da1b8eefa671d6685c22b1b3e049f984136efa2cef471af4f6e6", "ja": "普段よりも、体調管理に気をつけるのです！\n姫もちゃんと睡眠を取るように、心がけるのです♪", "zh": "平时要比往常更注意身体状况哦！\n姬也要好好保证睡眠，记得放在心上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d80c9aebaab21a61d44ad79b63ae8dd7a7022ead2f55eda4a9caf8931869f353", "ja": "（個性的な口調を活かしつつも、わかりやすく、\nしっかりした内容……これは好感触間違いないな！）", "zh": "（既发挥了独特的说话方式，又通俗易懂，内容也很扎实……这肯定会给人留下好印象！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1030_p", "source_sha256": "875bb93bae0e5f95c1dab96432b7dec8216046955e53baeedbd6c32d4a390623", "ja": "まつり、お疲れさま！", "zh": "茉莉，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "396d03ac5baaceef39ab36dfb42b987a3907e6faacd96da5993fe65221295361", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまなのです♪\n姫の初仕事、わんだほー！な出来ばえだったのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也辛苦了呢♪\n公主的第一份工作，表现得超～级精彩哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "1e6276e0485ba64702e3f5d95a0a242e1ff414055ad6a187e1b6e91f44b77734", "ja": "これも{$P$}さんが、姫の魅力を\nわかっていてくれたから、合格できたのです。", "zh": "这也是因为{$P$}先生了解本公主的魅力，才能顺利通过考核的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "f0628adea80bb94933f00225ee80fe80fc51625dd6d8bdda4c611921ff57e3e8", "ja": "本当に、ありがとうなのです。\nこの調子で、どんどんTV業界に進出するのですよ！", "zh": "真的，非常感谢您哦！就照这个势头，不断进军电视界吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5263ac82b6357fcab29cf8d663ab83f9ee15f747e3a0b69025b95eba3c65cc37", "ja": "（まつりの個性は、大きな魅力であり武器でもある。\nその事を、本人から改めて教わった気がするな……！）", "zh": "（茉莉的个性既是巨大的魅力，也是她的武器。\n感觉她又一次亲自让我明白了这一点……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
